  * CHARTER RULES (violations are returned, not audited):
    - No real-number `%` anywhere (ℝ is a field: a % b = 0). Residues live in
      ZMod; windings use explicit `∃ k : ℤ` terms.
    - Real exponents are written `((1:ℝ)/2)` or `Real.sqrt`, never `^(1/2)`.
